From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mukul Sikka <mukul.sikka@broadcom.com>
Subject: [PATCH] go.mod/go.sum: upgrade Go dependencies to LTS-compliant versions

Upgrade the following Go module dependencies to versions that are
present in the required LTS versions list:

  golang.org/x/crypto:          v0.36.0 -> v0.53.0
  golang.org/x/net:             v0.38.0 -> v0.55.0 (required by crypto v0.53.0)
  golang.org/x/sync:            v0.12.0 -> v0.21.0 (required by text v0.38.0)
  golang.org/x/sys:             v0.31.0 -> v0.46.0 (required by crypto v0.53.0)
  golang.org/x/text:            v0.23.0 -> v0.38.0 (required by crypto v0.53.0)
  github.com/spf13/pflag:       v1.0.5  -> v1.0.10
  github.com/spf13/cobra:       v1.7.0  -> v1.10.2
  github.com/hashicorp/go-uuid: v1.0.2  -> v1.0.3

crypto v0.53.0 requires go 1.25.0; the go directive in go.mod is
updated accordingly and the toolchain directive is removed.

go.sum is regenerated via `go mod tidy` with checksums from sum.golang.org.

Signed-off-by: Mukul Sikka <mukul.sikka@broadcom.com>
